Starts from the steady state of 2D_MSFR and run a point kinetics without 
traqnsient initiators. Used only to check whether the point kinetic solver
is capable of maintaining a steady state. 
The flag "initPrecursorsLiquidFuel" is set to true in nuclearData. This is used 
to create, at the first iteration, an equilibrium distribution of precursors 
(for the given salt velocity field). 
